
/* BUYRUNUZ — Tamam Studio product simulator (phone, game).
   Cozy kart racer through Turkish streets. Built from the product brief (no repo
   accessible): brand cream #FFE8C2 / brown #3A2418 / red #E63946, sea #3FB0D8,
   grass #7BC96F, road #5E5E66; Fredoka display + Nunito body. Flat CSS/SVG art,
   pseudo-3D road with one rAF loop. Tour: title → track select → race (Çay turbo,
   3/8 → 1/8) → finish with a rewarded-ad button. All names are fictional (Şoför, Zeynep, Simitçi Dayı); the
   only currency shown is the in-game "simit". No network, images or storage. */
